    Scenario: User sees the dashboard(Credit Card)(Existing Customer with Affiliate)
    Given I am on the login page
    When I enter "saad@cartpanda.com" in email field
    And I enter "Vista123+@" in password field
    And I click on Signin button
    Then I should see Select store Page
    And I click on "msaad" button
    Then I should see Dashboard Page
    And I click on order btn in sidebar
    And I click on all order
    Then I should see the order heading
    And I click on create button
    Then I should see create order page
    And I click on Add Products button
    And I click on the search bar and search the product "SHORTS"
    Then I select product form the dropdown
    And I click on the "choose" button
    Then I should see Order detail page
    Then I click on the Affiliate Field
    Then I enter affiliate name "SaadTest"
    Then I click on the searched affiliate and click on Select Button 
    Then I click on customer field
    Then I click customer field and enter "saadtest@gmail.com" and select it from the dropdown
    Then I should see the create order page
    Then I fill the following  form with the following data:
    | field         | value         |
    | notes         | test|
    | order_src     |test|
    And I select on the Payment method dropdown for Credit Card
    And I enter valid card details
    And I clicked on the save button for Card Details
    Then I should see the Add shipping popup
    And click on the free radio button
    And Click on the save button
    Then I should see the create order page
    And click on the order save button